{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107722","id":2605282504,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bSXTI","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107722","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107722.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107722.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107722","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107722/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107722/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107722/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/63b8e80c3e796d77d060a2d0d6f8463c92a2fde8","number":107722,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `@final` annotation for GDScript","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10500\r\n\r\nAdded `@final` for gdscript.\r\n\r\n```GDScript\r\n@final class A:\r\n    pass\r\n\r\nclass B extends A: # Error, cannot inherit a final class\r\n    pass\r\n\r\nclass C:\r\n    @final func a(): pass\r\n\r\nclass D extends C:\r\n    func a(): pass # Error, cannot override a final method\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote: You can annotate an anonymous script with `@final`, but when a script is declared without `extends` and the annotation is at the first line of the script, with a member following it:\r\n\r\n```GDScript\r\n@final\r\n\r\nfunc a(): pass\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn this case, you need to add `extends RefCounted` to avoid ambiguity.\r\n\r\n- **An abstract class/method cannot be final, and vice versa.**\r\n- **An virtual method cannot be final.** \r\n\r\n# Why adding `@final` as an annotation instead of a keyword?\r\n\r\nSee #107713 as a reference.\r\n\r\n# Tasks\r\n\r\n- [x] Complete basic functions.\r\n- [x] Unit tests.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","description":"","color":"ff7766","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,